Package: guatiao.serde
Type: Package
Title: JSON, TOML and YAML for 'guatiao' Values
Version: 0.0.0.1
Authors@R: person("jose-pr", email = "jose-pr@coqui.dev", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads JSON, TOML and YAML documents into values of the 'guatiao'
    package and writes them back, through the 'guatiao_serde' C library,
    every number keeping its exact text. The library itself is not
    included: it is opened at run time from the path in
    'GUATIAO_SERDE_LIBRARY' or 'GUATIAO_LIBRARY'.
License: MPL-2.0
URL: https://github.com/Boriken-Dev/guatiao, https://boriken-dev.github.io/guatiao/
BugReports: https://github.com/Boriken-Dev/guatiao/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.2), guatiao (>= 0.0.0.1)
LinkingTo: guatiao
Suggests: bit64
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: yes
